{{<html}}
{{$main}}

{{& page.contents.html}}

<section class="hero primary home-black">
    <div class="wrapper">
        <img
            src="{{baseUrl}}/images/logos/logo~dark.png"
            alt="Logo of {{site.name}}"
            title="{{site.name}}"
            >
        <p>Binary Birds</p>
        <h1>Software for the agentic era</h1>
        <p>We design and build applications<br>that put AI agents to work for your business.</p>
        <a class="button" href="mailto:info@binarybirds.com">Let's talk</a>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="primary home-gray">
    <div class="wrapper">
        <header>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-11V5l-8-3-8 3v6c0 7 8 11 8 11Z" />
                <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4" />
            </svg>
            <h2>Good software starts with quality</h2>
            <p>AI is changing how software is built and how businesses work. We help you see where AI agents can improve a product or a daily workflow, and where a simpler solution is the better fit.</p>
            <p>Last year, we used AI-assisted development to lay the groundwork for future products. AI is one part of our process: we plan each product carefully, design its systems, and review every change before it ships.</p>
            <p>That care extends to the tools we choose. Swift is one of the languages we trust to build software that’s safe to use, secure, reliable, efficient, and easy to maintain.</p>
        </header>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="services competences primary home-black">
    <div class="wrapper">
        <header>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M5 12h14" />
                <path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7" />
            </svg>
            <h2>From planning to delivery, end to end</h2>
            <p>Once we understand the opportunity, we shape the product with you, weigh the tradeoffs, and decide what to build first. Then our team can carry the plan through to production.</p>
        </header>
        <div class="grid grid-321 home-card-grid">
            <div class="card">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <rect x="8" y="2" width="8" height="4" rx="1" />
                    <path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2" />
                    <path d="M9 11h6M9 16h6" />
                    <path d="m6.5 11 .5.5 1-1M6.5 16l.5.5 1-1" />
                </svg>
                <h3>Product planning</h3>
                <p>Clarify requirements, validate ideas, and decide what belongs in the first release.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="m8 8-4 4 4 4m8-8 4 4-4 4m-3-9-2 10" />
                </svg>
                <h3>Custom software</h3>
                <p>Build backend services, websites, and native apps for Apple platforms and Android, shaped around your users and business.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M21 11.5a8.5 8.5 0 0 1-8.5 8.5H4l1.5-4.5A8.5 8.5 0 1 1 21 11.5Z" />
                    <circle cx="8.5" cy="12" r=".5" />
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r=".5" />
                    <circle cx="15.5" cy="12" r=".5" />
                </svg>
                <h3>Technical consulting</h3>
                <p>Get hands-on guidance on architecture, delivery, and technical decisions from a team that can implement the changes.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <header class="centered">
            <p>We build around your business: simple user experiences, AI workflows that solve a clear problem, and well-structured software your team can understand and extend.</p>
        </header>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="home-gray">
    <div class="wrapper">
        <header>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <rect x="3" y="8" width="18" height="13" rx="2" />
                <path d="M7 8V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3M3 13h18M10 12v2h4v-2" />
            </svg>
            <h2>We build and use our own tools</h2>
            <p>We build our own tools and infrastructure so we can deliver software that’s fast and affordable to run. Having control over the foundations helps us maintain a high standard across projects.</p>
        </header>
        <div class="grid grid-321 home-card-grid">
            <div class="card tool-card">
                <img class="medium" src="{{baseUrl}}/images/footer/feather-cms-logo.png" alt="Feather CMS logo">
                <h3>Feather CMS</h3>
                <p>An open-source Swift CMS for teams building a content platform around their product.</p>
                <p><a href="https://feathercms.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Learn more →</a></p>
            </div>
            <div class="card tool-card">
                <img class="medium" src="{{baseUrl}}/images/footer/feather-framework-logo.png" alt="Feather Framework logo">
                <h3>Feather Framework</h3>
                <p>Reusable Swift components for building reliable backend services around your product needs.</p>
                <p><a href="https://feather-framework.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Learn more →</a></p>
            </div>
            <div class="card tool-card">
                <img class="medium" src="{{baseUrl}}/images/footer/toucan-logo.png" alt="Toucan logo">
                <h3>Toucan</h3>
                <p>A Swift static site generator for fast websites with a simple, dependable content workflow.</p>
                <p><a href="https://toucansites.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Learn more →</a></p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <header class="centered">
            <p>Modular systems and explicit API contracts help both our team and AI coding agents understand, review, and extend the codebase.</p>
            <a class="button" href="https://github.com/binarybirds/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">See our work on GitHub</a>
        </header>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="primary home-black">
    <div class="wrapper">
        <header>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2" />
            </svg>
            <h2>What our clients say</h2>
            <p>We build long-term partnerships and take responsibility for what we deliver. Here’s what our clients say about working with us.</p>
        </header>
        <div class="grid grid-221">
            {{#context.testimonials}}
                {{> partials.testimonial}}
            {{/context.testimonials}}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="contact-us home-gray">
    <div class="wrapper">
        <header>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2" />
                <path d="m3 7 9 6 9-6" />
            </svg>
            <h2>Have a product idea or a workflow to improve?</h2>
            <p>Tell us where you are and we can work out the next step together.</p>
        </header>
        <div>
            <p>Send us an e-mail at info@binarybirds.com.</p>
            <a class="button" href="mailto:info@binarybirds.com">Get in touch</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

{{/main}}
{{/html}}
